    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051107.0034\n\nCAIRO, Nov. 7 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nXinhua Mideast news advisory -- Nov. 7\n\n\n\n\nThe following major international news stories from the Middle East region are scheduled to be covered or pursued by Xinhua News Agency on Monday.\n\n-- US and Iraqi forces continued a major offensive, Operation Steel Curtain, to eradicate al-Qaida fighters in western Iraq near the Syrian border.\n\n-- UN Secretary General Kofi Annan arrived in Cairo on a three- day visit to Egypt as part of his tour which will also take him to Saudi Arabia and Tunisia.\n\n-- Palestinian Civil Affairs Minister Mohammed Dahlan will inspect Rafah crossing on the Egypt-Gaza border with some European officials and experts, who have been engaged as the third party in seeking the proper involvement in rerunning the cross.",
